{"schemaVersion":1,"sourceRecord":{"schemaVersion":1,"recordId":"wikibooks-22440-r4615198","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceTitle":"Cookbook:Macaroni and Cheese (Baked)","sourcePageId":22440,"sourceRevision":"4615198","sourceRevisionTimestamp":"2026-02-03T02:37:22Z","sourceRevisionUser":"Kittycataclysm","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Macaroni%20and%20Cheese%20(Baked)&oldid=4615198","retrievedAt":"2026-10-13T13:08:19.708Z","sourceCategories":["Category:Baked recipes","Category:Boiled recipes","Category:Medium Difficulty recipes","Category:Recipes","Category:Recipes for macaroni and cheese","Category:Recipes using bay leaf","Category:Recipes using bread crumb","Category:Recipes using butter","Category:Recipes using cheddar","Category:Recipes using cow milk","Category:Recipes using egg","Category:Recipes using mustard powder","Category:Recipes using pasta and noodles","Category:Recipes using wheat flour","Category:Recipes without cooking time","Category:Recipes without servings","Category:Side dish recipes","Category:Vegetarian recipes"],"license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikibooks:Copyrights","policyStatus":"verified-license","pageExceptionStatus":"not-reviewed-per-page","attribution":"Attribute Wikibooks contributors by linking each version-specific source page. Indicate that structured fields are extracted and any translated or edited text is modified. Include CC BY-SA 4.0 notice/link and share adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0 or later.","changeNoticeRequired":true,"shareAlikeRequired":true},"sourceSha256":"92e8949d2c014fbe341a1da0db1eabd3793a5b0c64b551e38810449bb5983308","sourceWikitext":"__NOTOC__\n{{Recipe summary\n| Category = Pasta recipes\n| Difficulty = 3\n}}\n\n{{recipe}} | [[Cookbook:Pasta|Pasta]] \n\n== Ingredients ==\n\n=== Base ===\n* ½ [[Cookbook:Pound|lb]] (227 [[Cookbook:Gram|g]]) dry elbow [[Cookbook:Macaroni|macaroni]]\n* 3 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|Tbsp]] [[Cookbook:Butter|butter]]\n* 3 Tbsp [[Cookbook:Flour|flour]]\n* 1 Tbsp [[Cookbook:Mustard#dry mustard|powdered mustard]]\n* 3 [[Cookbook:Cup|cups]] [[Cookbook:Milk|milk]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Red onion|red onion]], finely [[Cookbook:Chopping|chopped]]\n* 2 [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|tsp]] [[Cookbook:Tabasco Sauce|Tabasco]] pepper sauce\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Bay Leaf|bay leaf]]\n* ½ tsp [[Cookbook:Paprika|paprika]]\n* 1 standard [[Cookbook:Egg|egg]]\n* 12 [[Cookbook:Ounce|oz]] (340 [[Cookbook:Gram|g]]) [[Cookbook:Cheddar Cheese|sharp cheddar]], [[Cookbook:Grate|shredded]]\n* 1 tsp [[Cookbook:Salt|salt]]\n* Fresh black [[Cookbook:Pepper|pepper]]\n\n=== Topping ===\n* 3 Tbsp butter\n* 1 cup panko [[Cookbook:Bread Crumb|bread crumbs]]\n\n== Procedure ==\n# Preheat [[Cookbook:Oven|oven]] to 350 °[[Cookbook:F|F]].\n# In a large pot of [[Cookbook:Boiling|boiling]], salted water, cook the pasta until it is [[Cookbook:Al Dente|al dente]].\n# While the pasta is cooking, melt the butter in a separate pot. \n# [[Cookbook:Whisk|Whisk]] in the flour and mustard and keep it moving for about five minutes. Make sure it is free of lumps.\n# Stir in the milk, onion, bay leaf, and paprika. [[Cookbook:Simmering|Simmer]] for ten minutes and remove the bay leaf.\n# [[Cookbook:Tempering|Temper]] in the egg.\n# Stir in ¾ of the cheese.\n# Season with salt and pepper.\n# [[Cookbook:Folding|Fold]] the macaroni into the mix and pour into a 2-[[Cookbook:Quart|quart]] [[Cookbook:Baking Dish|casserole dish]].\n# Top with remaining cheese.\n# Melt the butter in a [[Cookbook:Sauté Pan|sauté pan]], add breadcrumbs, and [[Cookbook:Mixing#Tossing|toss]] to coat.\n# Top the macaroni with the bread crumbs.\n# [[Cookbook:Baking|Bake]] for 30 minutes.\n# Remove from oven and rest for 10 minutes before serving.\n\n[[Category:Recipes using pasta and noodles]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cheddar]]\n[[Category:Vegetarian recipes]]\n[[Category:Boiled recipes]]\n[[Category:Baked recipes]]\n[[Category:Side dish recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using butter]]\n[[Category:Recipes for macaroni and cheese]]\n[[Category:Recipes using bay leaf]]\n[[Category:Recipes using bread crumb]]\n[[Category:Recipes using egg]]\n[[Category:Recipes using wheat flour]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cow milk]]\n[[Category:Recipes using mustard powder]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Macaroni and Cheese (Baked)","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"½ lb (227 g) dry elbow macaroni","sourceText":"½ lb (227 g) dry elbow macaroni","amountText":"½ lb (227 g) dry elbow macaroni","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"3 Tbsp butter","sourceText":"3 Tbsp butter","amountText":"3 Tbsp butter","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"3 Tbsp flour","sourceText":"3 Tbsp flour","amountText":"3 Tbsp flour","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"1 Tbsp powdered mustard","sourceText":"1 Tbsp powdered mustard","amountText":"1 Tbsp powdered mustard","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-5","name":"3 cups milk","sourceText":"3 cups milk","amountText":"3 cups milk","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-6","name":"1 red onion, finely chopped","sourceText":"1 red onion, finely chopped","amountText":"1 red onion, finely chopped","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-7","name":"2 tsp Tabasco pepper sauce","sourceText":"2 tsp Tabasco pepper sauce","amountText":"2 tsp Tabasco pepper sauce","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-8","name":"1 bay leaf","sourceText":"1 bay leaf","amountText":"1 bay leaf","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-9","name":"½ tsp paprika","sourceText":